<!-- The TTAB trial brief's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the
     typst template (Times New Roman) at 12 pt (size 24 half points); Body Text (and First Paragraph) double-spaced
     in 24 pt exact line boxes with a half-inch first-line indent (37 CFR 2.126(a)(1); typst pitch-double); block
     quotations single-spaced (13.8 pt, typst pitch-single), a half inch in on both sides, 14 pt above and below;
     footnotes at the body size, single-spaced, 7 pt apart; US Letter, 1 in margins. ttab-trial-brief.lua writes the
     caption page, the table of authorities, the headings, the signature block and the certificate with the typst
     template's pitches and spaces, the front matter's roman sections and the body's last section (arabic from 1);
     fb render writes the footer (docxpass.rs). Twips: 20 x pt. -->
<reference xmlns:w="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" base="xengine" size="24" body="480" single="276" indent="720" quote="280" note-after="140"/>
